  "body": "## Summary\n\nFixes the model breakdown for OpenCode plugin-backed models recorded by Codex CLI.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Decode `opencode-go/<model>` and `opencode-free/<model>` namespaces from Codex records instead of trusting the compatibility `openai` provider field.\n- Keep `deepseek-v4-flash` unpriced until a trusted provider rate is configured, even when OpenRouter returns a matching rate.\n- Preserve `deepseek-v4-flash-free` as explicitly free.\n- Add regression tests covering provider normalization, paid DeepSeek pricing suppression, and the free variant.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `uv run python -m unittest tests.test_app tests.test_readme -v`\n- `scripts/review.sh`\n- `uv run python -m py_compile app.py scripts/snapshot_dashboard.py`\n- Live source data reproduced the original Codex `openai` compatibility provider and namespaced model ID.\n\nFixes #50\n",
  "changed_files": 3,
